  "title": "IMPERIAL PETROLEUM INC. ANNOUNCES THE DATE FOR THE RELEASE OF THE FOURTH QUARTER AND TWELVE MONTHS 2025 FINANCIAL AND OPERATING RESULTS, CONFERENCE CALL AND WEBCAST",
  "summary": "ATHENS, GREECE March 2, 2026 . Imperial Petroleum Inc. is a ship-owning company providing petroleum products, crude oil and drybulk seaborne transportation services, announced today that it will release its fourth quarter and twelve months financial and operating results for the period ended December 31, 2025 before the market opens in New York on March 6, 2026.",
